    <briefdescription>
<para>Line entries are used to encode the line tables in <ref refid="structllvm_1_1gsym_1_1_function_info" kindref="compound">FunctionInfo</ref> objects. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>They are stored as a sorted vector of these objects and store the address, file and line of the line table row for a given address. The size of a line table entry is calculated by looking at the next entry in the <ref refid="structllvm_1_1gsym_1_1_function_info" kindref="compound">FunctionInfo</ref>&apos;s vector of entries. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
